        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "showMessage",
            "lines": [
              "Below the Bulwark's fortifications, the Monument's true architecture reveals itself. A massive vertical shaft plunges into the earth, its walls carved with geometric patterns that glow faintly in the darkness.",
              "Wind rushes upward through the shaft \u2014 not natural wind, but something generated by the structure itself. The air moves in spiraling patterns, following channels carved into the ancient stone.",
              "Narrow bridges of worked stone span the void. Far below, you can see more ledges, more bridges, descending in a spiral pattern. The Bulwark's excavation equipment lies abandoned on the first few ledges \u2014 they didn't get far before retreating."
